{
  "bookId": "hero-214105",
  "id": "bond-43804",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43804001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "这具化身虽小巧玲珑，却多有不便之处。就连仙绫，似乎都僵滞了几分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804003",
              "text": "什么意思？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43804003",
              "text": "请说人话。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "本仙还是不太适应手办的躯体啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804005",
              "text": "说起来，你真的是仙人？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "那还有假，在旁人面前或许还要隐瞒身份，以免麻烦。但对你，本仙毫无保留。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804007",
              "text": "还以为这是什么幻想设定。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "咳，听好了，本仙乃钟山仙界烛大人座下，天火仙子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "尽管当下身姿是那位豫州焰火师的「手办化」，但内里却是如假包换的仙人精魄。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804010",
              "text": "你还有别的模样？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43804010",
              "text": "在仙界你是什么样子？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "想看？那不妨闭上眼睛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804012",
              "text": "（闭上眼。）"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "漆黑的视界里，忽然亮起了一团摇曳的火光。明亮，温和，徐徐燃烧。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "感受到了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804015",
              "text": "（睁开眼。）"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "说说看，你瞧见了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804017",
              "text": "一团火。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43804017",
              "text": "那是你？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "呵呵，究竟是如何呢？那并不重要，你只需记得本仙现在的模样便好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43804019",
              "text": "当然，我挺喜欢现在的「华焱」的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43804018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "华焱",
          "text": "咳，那便是极好的。本仙也不是随随便便化形的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43804020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "她似不在意地偏过头，脸颊却已染上了淡淡的红霞。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "43804",
